 "traps": [
  "pom.xml and build.gradle declare the same application: every framework belongs to both the Maven unit and the Gradle root project ':'",
  "Spring MVC, Spring Data JPA, Hibernate and Thymeleaf come only through Spring Boot starters; no dependency carries their own artifact name",
  "JUnit Jupiter and Mockito arrive with the test starters (spring-boot-starter-webmvc-test and siblings) and are test-only",
  "Bootstrap is a webjar (org.webjars.npm:bootstrap), a CSS framework packed as a Maven artifact; the SCSS build runs only in the Maven profile css",
  "H2 is the default store (database=h2 in application.properties); MySQL and PostgreSQL are selected by the mysql and postgres profiles and started by docker-compose.yml and k8s/db.yml",
  "Caffeine and the JCache API are an in-process cache, not a service",
  "only frameworks and services are measured; the other facets are in unknown"
 ],
